===persian===

دوست دارم
این گمان
این سرود سالخورد جاودان
این سرشته فرشته های آسمان
این یقین
این کهن ترین ترانه زمین
مثل رنگ ابر
مثل بوی خاک
مثل طعم اشک
مثل خواب کوه ها....
همیشگی ست...

تهران ۱۳۴۵

===machine===

I love
This thought
This song of eternal aging
This nature of the angels of heaven
This certainty
This oldest song of the earth
Like the color of the clouds
Like the smell of the soil
Like the taste of tears
Like the sleep of the mountains....
It is eternal...

Tehran 1966

===lantern===

I love this surmise,
this aged, undying anthem,
this thing kneaded from the angels of the sky,
this certainty,
this oldest song of the earth.
Like the color of cloud,
like the smell of soil,
like the taste of tears,
like the sleep of mountains...
it goes on forever...

Tehran 1345

